; collision_layer = 0 (nao e solido, so deteta). Custo/energia em koliani.gd.
; Cabeca = orbe azul a girar (bdragon1727 "Free Effect and Bullet 16x16",
; folha Water) a puxar o feixe -> assets/sprites/pixel/fx/bala_azul.png.
